            "review_text": "Dreamer04457898336\n2 contributions\n0\nGood lunch\nJun 2025 • Solo\nI tried Com Tam Moc inside the mall and it was a pleasant surprise. The rice was soft and fragrant, paired perfectly with the grilled pork chop which was juicy and flavorful. The side dishes were fresh and nicely balanced, making the whole meal very satisfying. Service was quick and friendly, and the prices are reasonable for the quality. A good spot if you’re craving a classic Vietnamese broken rice dish while shopping at the mall.\nRead more\nWritten October 1, 2025",
