            "review_text": "スパマキシマム\nNagoya, Japan5741 contributions\n0\nEnjoy the authentic comtam in Ho Chi Minh City!\nSep 2024 • Solo\nI wanted to eat authentic comtam in Ho Chi Minh City\nIt's in the basement of the commercial Bincom Center.\nI went to a Comtum specialty store.\n\nIt was pretty bustling with fancy shops.\nThe staff can only speak Vietnamese.\n\nIn the meantime, point to the menu with the picture\nOrder chicken comtum and Tiger beer.\n\nIt was subtle to drink watery beer with ice.\nThe sweet and salty chicken leg is the best\nIt went great with white rice and was delicious!!\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten October 25, 2024",
